# Testing Standards

## Rules
- Unit test coverage: minimum 80% (Services, Repositories)
- All features must have tests before merge
- Bug fixes must have regression tests
- Use Pest for PHP, Playwright for E2E

## Pest Unit Test
```php
describe('UserService', function () {
    it('throws exception when user not found', function () {
        $repo = Mockery::mock(UserRepository::class);
        $repo->shouldReceive('findById')->andReturn(null);
        $service = new UserService($repo);

        expect(fn () => $service->findById(999))
            ->toThrow(AppException::class, 'User not found');
    });
});
```

## Pest Feature (HTTP) Test
```php
it('creates user with valid data', function () {
    $admin = User::factory()->admin()->create();

    $this->actingAs($admin, 'sanctum')
        ->postJson('/api/v1/users', ['name' => 'John', 'email' => 'j@test.com', 'password' => 'secret123'])
        ->assertCreated()
        ->assertJsonPath('data.email', 'j@test.com');
});
```

## Commands
```bash
php artisan test                    # All tests
php artisan test --coverage --min=80
./vendor/bin/pest --parallel
npx playwright test
```
